1
00:00:00,069 --> 00:00:04,229
(Leonard:)I push my shoulder against
the secret door to see if it gives way.

2
00:00:04,407 --> 00:00:06,667
Uh-huh. It does.

3
00:00:09,445 --> 00:00:11,675
(Sheldon:)He does sound effects too.

4
00:00:13,149 --> 00:00:15,379
(Leonard:)Hey, I always did sound effects.

5
00:00:15,551 --> 00:00:18,921
Uh, a swarm of bloodthirsty bats
fly through the dungeon.

6
00:00:22,225 --> 00:00:25,025
(Leonard:)Uh, uh, they attack a nearby unicorn.

7
00:00:31,033 --> 00:00:33,933
(Sheldon:)Okay, well, I have a sound effect
for those sound effects.

8
00:00:37,473 --> 00:00:40,203
- Guess who?
- What are you doing back?

9
00:00:40,410 --> 00:00:42,540
(Bernadette:)That's an excellent question. Amy?

10
00:00:43,579 --> 00:00:44,979
(Raj:)Uh, well...

11
00:00:46,115 --> 00:00:50,105
(Amy:)...when we were going through security,
I got pulled out of line for a pat-down.

12
00:00:50,553 --> 00:00:53,543
(Amy:)The, uh, TSA agent got a little handsy.

13
00:00:54,724 --> 00:00:59,024
(Amy:)I may have broken her nose
with my elbow.

